# Line endings: store and check out text files with LF on every OS.
# Hash-locked evidence (backtest/data, eval windows, PROTOCOL.md, golden
# masters, contract fixtures) is compared byte-for-byte; a CRLF checkout on
# Windows (core.autocrlf=true) breaks those locks without changing any data.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary
*.rds binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.xlsx binary
*.gz binary
